Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.19,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:12.47,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha—?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking ya, how much\Nlonger before we land?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How long ya been standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What're ya spacing out about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you land quickly so I can\Nhand over that musty-looking fugitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you haven't even\Ngotten permission to land yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. You guys are so obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't rush so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And take care of the\Nairport end for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Ganymede was your homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you perhaps thinking about some\Nwoman in the past that cried over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps a woman that made {\i1}you{\i0} cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't ya hear me when I said\Nyou're being obnoxious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:03:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Ganymede police.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Donelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, Jet! Jet, it's you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no mistake...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The top of your head's gotten rather{\i0}\N{\i1}lonely, but it's still Jet all right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Donelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm surprised that you're working{\i0}\N{\i1}around here. Has it been...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seven years? Eight?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell's up with you{\i0}\N{\i1}to come back so suddenly?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hand over a bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanted ad number EX41285.\NBaker Panchorero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To think you're a bounty hunter...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You, who was called the Black Dog,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.91,0:04:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a mad dog that never let{\i0}\N{\i1}go of things bitten into?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought {\i1}you{\i0} had already retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, I'm still an active officer!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't judge things on your time scale,\Nyou Rip Van Winkle you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:56.67,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,That example is completely reversed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to be a cop? That explains...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:05:00.01,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm just glad to see yer still kickin'.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why I don't get along with him. {snapped to end keyframe to make this less messy feeling}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:02.49,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you, too. {snapped to end keyframe to make this less messy feeling}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh yeah. what was her name...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know! Alisa!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a little joint in the port of Marvis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A small bar called "La Fin".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But in this recession, I hear\Nshe's got a lot of debts to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are a lot of problems\Nfor a woman trying to live alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sense of justice and duty, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First time in a while he's home,\Nof course he's gonna go visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally wrong if you think\Nyour old woman still thinks about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally wrong yourself if you think\Nevery other woman thinks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice and duty, duty, three o'clock tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, men
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,are hopeless romantics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you rubbing that stuff on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful skin is maintained by\Ncontinued effort that seems futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Futile! Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,La Fin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... and you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,An old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the area for\Nthe first time in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alisa... isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really Jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He is my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it? You want a glass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my last customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm closing shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.71,0:08:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The number of ships decreased,\Nand this area has gotten desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of moving to a new town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,On the new island cities,\Nmortgage is expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you able to manage all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so like you to worry about such things. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to change\Nmyself in the new town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Rhint is here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy that was just here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, I already have 3 kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding. It was a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhint is just my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gotten married yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I live and wander with a group of weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And on top of it, I'm a bounty hunter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's Jet?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing personal stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're his partner, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've got news on a bounty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This hasn't been{\i0}\N{\i1}publicly broadcast yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rhint Celonius.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A thug in the port of Marvis.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Last night, he contacted{\i0}\N{\i1}financial broker Law Rentzuo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy was another tough guy,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he was killed!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rhint is Alisa's gigolo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought I'd warn you guys.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And how much is the bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, when I got home from work,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,you always waited for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When I came home, only that watch was left
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and a small note with one word: "farewell".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I didn't feel sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,lacked reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gradually felt something\Ninside me go numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,After 6 months, I made a bet with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That I would leave this\Nplanet if you didn't return
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,by the time this clock stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here to blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to know
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,why you disappeared back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to think that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,time on Ganymede had stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a story from long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've... forgotten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need time that stands still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.23,0:14:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A bounty hunter? Then can he be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhint...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bounty on my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I borrowed\Nmoney from a guy like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and you protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be saved if I get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,killed a guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here. {original: "outta"}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, just the two of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be because I have good karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Steer for me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey? What's wrong?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm after a bounty worth 1.8 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here, I'll send it to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bounty? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, a secret bit of info from Donelly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.85,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He apparently killed a loan shark.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do this. You can go back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna let him go, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the land where I was a cop.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Black Dog.\NOnce I bite, I never let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets about her, but I'll\Nsettle this score on my home turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sense of justice and duty, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you hear me...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop the boat, now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other bounties to find!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:20:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I let you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,someone will come for you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you run, you will become an accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You were like this back then, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You decided everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were always right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.07,0:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was with you,\NI never had to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was hang on to your arm\Nlike a child, with no cares in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to decide how to\Nlive my life by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if that was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go! I don't wanna go to prison! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Self-defense seems to\Nbe how they see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.01,0:21:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be going anywhere anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will wait in my store... for Rhint.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't take long
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,because time is flowing along.
