Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.51,0:24:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,An unseen terror assaults the Bebop crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.90,0:24:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Caught by the venomous fangs of the\Nunseen enemy, another victim falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.83,0:24:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the identity of the fearsome\Nenemy that refuses to show itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.68,0:24:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A symphony of shivers that will send\Nyou into the deepest trenches of terror! {9 frames but made it 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.29,0:24:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Toys in the Attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.98,0:24:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the channel is set,\Nyou will no longer be able to escape...
